  "id": "wellbutrin",
  "term": "Wellbutrin",
  "definition": "Wellbutrin is a brand name for bupropion hydrochloride, a medication with antidepressant effects. It may also be used to help with smoking cessation and to improve sexual desire, and it acts in part by weakly reducing neuronal reuptake of serotonin, dopamine, and norepinephrine and by blocking central nicotinic acetylcholine receptors.",
